        "x1": 0.6703776040641417,
        "y1": 0.6426144827911946
      },
      "text": "participante de una identidad mayor (DE CAMPOS, 2008).",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.202412148088423,
        "y0": 0.6473180176141551,
        "x1": 0.8533205835759812,
        "y1": 0.6604309024035092
      },
      "text": "La literatura regionalista de tema gauchesco seguiría la misma tendencia",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.6651344372264698,
        "x1": 0.2480104806914506,
        "y1": 0.6782473220158239
      },
      "text": "durante su",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2592555202880646,
        "y0": 0.6651344372264698,
        "x1": 0.8590129228686882,
        "y1": 0.6782473220158239
      },
      "text": "edad de oro. De acuerdo con Ligia Chiappini,  dentro de esta",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.6829508749625838,
        "x1": 0.8590246491604239,
        "y1": 0.6960637597519379
      },
      "text": "tradición literaria “el personaje no solo es reducido a un tipo social, sino a un",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.7007672945748984,
        "x1": 0.8591963784601597,
        "y1": 0.7138801793642526
      },
      "text": "tipo social mitificado: el gaucho y su antípoda  –el  antigaucho,  el antihéroe”",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.7185837141872131,
        "x1": 0.3468370786847698,
        "y1": 0.7316965989765674
      },
