        "y0": 0.8329294980682379,
        "x1": 0.7258811288885009,
        "y1": 0.8447596007361243
      },
      "text": "mitificado: o gaúcho heroi e seu antípoda – o antigaúcho, o anti-herói”.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.14295504313118232,
        "y0": 0.875399088596763,
        "x1": 0.48318379894344504,
        "y1": 0.8860889403641519
      },
